    Full text: LICENSE.MPL-2.0

SPDX expression: AGPL-3.0-or-later OR MPL-2.0

Pick one. You do not have to comply with both.

Why two
-------

The AGPL is the licence this engine was published under, and it stays the
default: anyone who builds on this work, including over a network, publishes
their changes in turn.

The MPL was added on 2026-08-30 so the engine can be embedded in the Shinkofa
browser, which is a Firefox derivative and therefore MPL-2.0 throughout. A
browser cannot ship AGPL code without pulling the whole product under the AGPL.

The copyright holder is the sole author of the code in this package and is free
to offer it under both.

This package does have runtime dependencies (fuse.js, idb, tweetnacl,
y-indexeddb, yjs, zod, and a peer dependency on effect). They are separate
works, each under its own permissive licence — Apache-2.0, ISC, Unlicense or
MIT — and none of them constrains the licence offered here. The pomodoro modules
(`./pomodoro`, `./pomodoro-strip`) import none of them.

The other packages in this repository (`adapter`, `wasm-core`) remain
AGPL-3.0-or-later only.
